        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 6547 Mortise Nashville Entry Set with 5020 Colonial Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe solid brass Nashville Entrance Set made by Baldwin comes finished in a PVD Polished Brass that is backed by a lifetime warranty; and since this traditional styled entry set meets the high standards of quality that Baldwin is known for, it also has a limited lifetime mechanical warranty. It will fit 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" door thicknesses with backsets of 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\". The 6547 Nashville Entryset is available in single cylinder and dummy set functions. The classic rectangular design when paired with the 5020 Colonial Knob makes this entry set perfect for traditional homes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMortise locks have been, and still are, the established norm for Europe and much of the rest of the world. In the early 1960’s Baldwin brought residential mortise locks to America. They ‘founded’ the residential mortise industry and continue to be the leader – so much so that their competitors have bought Baldwin locks for their own products.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available: Matching <a href=\"/products/colonial-knobset-baldwin-5020\"><b>Baldwin Colonial Door Knobs</b></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Traditional 6547 Nashville Door Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Certified by Underwriters Laboratories (UL) for use on fire doors up to three-hour rating.</li>\r\n<li>Made of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-duty mortise lock body.</li>\r\n<li>Forged brass mechanical.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt with two hardened inserts.</li>\r\n<li>Reinforced steel security strike with three inch screws.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with two keys.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Limited Warranty</b> on workmanship, materials, operation and finish.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Baldwin Estate Collection Nashville Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Lifetime PVD Polished Brass</b></li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim: 5020 Knob</li>\r\n<li>Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: .312\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.25\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2.187\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" or 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset:  2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-6547.pdf?v=1691094973\" target=\"new\"><b>Nashville Entry Set Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-estate_mortise_dimensions.pdf?v=1691094972\" target=\"new\"><b>Mortise Box Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a knob operates the entrance set latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-2-Functions-entryset.jpg?v=1704354585\" width=\"250\" height=\"100\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Baldwin Functions Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Nashville Mortise Entrance Set, Baldwin 6547",
                "description": "Baldwin 6547 Nashville Entry Set - The solid brass Nashville Entrance Set made by Baldwin comes finished in a PVD Polished Brass that is backed by a lifetime warranty; and since this traditional styled entry set meets the high standards of quality that Baldwin is known for, it also has a limited lifetime mechanical warranty. It will fit 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses with backsets of 2-1/2 inches or 2-3/4 inches. The 6547 Nashville Entryset is available in single cylinder and dummy set functions. The classic rectangular design when paired with the 5020 Colonial Knob makes this entry set perfect for traditional homes.",
                "keywords": "baldwin 6547, BAL-6547, bladwin Nashville entrance sets, baldwin Nashville entrysets, square entry sets, traditional entry sets, solid brass entrysets, mortise entrysets, mortise entrance sets, mortise handlesets, single cylinder entrance sets, traditional front door hardware, baldwin estate collection entry sets, baldwin estates collection entrance sets,"
